OL,3,GNEWSAMum elated with son's new school
OL,4,Apackage
OL,5,
OL,6,FA mother whose autistic son was getting
OL,7,Fjust one hour of school a day has said
OL,8,Fshe "cannot believe" he will finally
OL,9,Fget the care and education he needs.
OL,11,FRoxanne said six-year-old Franklin was
OL,12,Frejected by three different specialist
OL,13,Fschools before the start of the new
OL,14,Fterm in September.
OL,16,FBut she received a phone call last week
OL,17,Ffrom Suffolk County Council, to say her
OL,18,Fson had been approved for two
OL,19,Falternative provision units and would
OL,20,Freceive tutoring at their home in
OL,21,FMartlesham.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
